MARKETZED ANDROID — ADDITIONAL FEATURES, UI IMPROVEMENTS & MARKETPLACE ENHANCEMENTS

Product: MarketZed — Zambia Marketplace
Brand: Tech Generative Universe (TechGU)
Platform: Native Android — Kotlin + Jetpack Compose
Purpose: Extend the existing MarketZed application with the following features and improvements.

1. IMPLEMENTATION INSTRUCTIONS

Implement all the following improvements in the existing MarketZed application.

This is an extension of the previous complete implementation specification.

NON-NEGOTIABLE REQUIREMENTS:

- Preserve existing working functionality.
- Inspect the existing implementation before making changes.
- Continue using Kotlin and Jetpack Compose.
- Preserve existing Firebase Authentication.
- Preserve existing Firestore architecture.
- Preserve the existing payment provider.
- Maintain professional light and dark themes.
- Maintain the approved MarketZed orange branding.
- Prioritize simplicity, performance and accessibility.
- Do not introduce Gemini AI.
- Do not introduce Google Sign-In.
- Do not replace working integrations with mock implementations.

