11.4 Easy removal before production

This requirement is extremely important.

All test data must be clearly separated from production data.

Create a dedicated test-data mechanism.

Possible implementation:

- Development-only fixture repository.
- Debug build seed command.
- Dedicated development Firestore collection.
- Test data namespace.
- Environment-based test-data flag.

Example conceptual setting:

MARKETZED_TEST_DATA_ENABLED=true

Production:

MARKETZED_TEST_DATA_ENABLED=false

The exact mechanism must match the existing architecture.

Requirements:

- Never insert test listings into genuine production marketplace collections.
- Never mix test and real seller records.
